  "releaseNotes": "Release notes look best on GitHub: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/releases/tag/v8.12.16\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at main -->\n## What's Changed\n### New Features 🎉\n* feat: instance contextual layout fetching by @Jondyr in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1544\n* feat: let system users use level-4 apps that relax the level for system users (apps on .NET 10) by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1896\n* feat: preview PDF and subform PDF tasks in v8 by @bjorntore in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1899\n### Bugfixes 🐛\n* fix: link attachments to their repeating group row when copying an instance, so they show up in the form by @phlipsterit in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1894\n* fix(app-backend): parse the system user claims more defensively by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1897\n* fix: don't report empty derived field values for keys Storage already removed by @bjorntore in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1903\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/compare/v8.12.15...v8.12.16",
